{"id":"etiquetes-de-format-i-estructura","title":"Etiquetes de format i estructura","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","javascript"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":1,"text":"Sin título","id":"sin-titulo"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":37,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-02-07-05-26","title":"Sesion_02_07.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":2}],"html":"<h1 id=\"sin-titulo\" class=\"note__h note__h--1\">Sin título</h1><h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Són etiquetes que serveixen per donar forma al text i l&#39;estructura:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Títols</strong>: <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> (més important) fins a <code>&lt;h6&gt;</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Paràgrafs i salts</strong>: <code>&lt;p&gt;</code> per a paràgrafs i <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> per a salts de línia.</li>\n<li><strong>Format</strong>: <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> (negreta), <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> (cursiva), <code>&lt;sub&gt;</code> (subíndice).</li>\n<li><strong>Semàntica</strong>: Etiquetes com <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;main&gt;</code> i <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code> que expliquen el significat de cada part de la web als cercadors .</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span> \n\t<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Títol de la web<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">main</span>&gt;</span> \n\t<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>Això és un text amb <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">strong</span>&gt;</span>negreta<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">strong</span>&gt;</span>.\n\t<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>L&#x27;aigua és H<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">sub</span>&gt;</span>2<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">sub</span>&gt;</span>O.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">main</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>"}